name: Greedy Joker — diamonds juice
author: corpus
description: >-
  Greedy Joker gives +3 Mult per played Diamond. A first-shop suit engine: want it
  early alongside Diamond density, suit-fixing (Smeared merges red suits), and The
  Idol locking a Diamond rank. Avoid The Window boss (debuffs Diamonds).
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - joker: GreedyJoker
    antes: [1]
    sources:
      shopItems: [0, 1, 2, 3]
      boosterPacks: [0, 1]
should:
  - joker: SmearedJoker
    antes: [1, 2]
    score: 50
  - joker: TheIdol
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 35
  - standardCard:
      suit: Diamonds
    label: "Any Diamond"
    antes: [1, 2]
    score: 15
mustNot:
  - boss: TheWindow
    antes: [1]
